            "header": "STEP",
            "label": "If installing a new steering gear, remove the dust caps.",
            "body": "<ul><li>Install the high pressure hose (HE80293) from pump to steering gear. It goes on the <strong>port closest to the front</strong> of the Jeep.</li><li>You may need to clock the hose slightly for a clean fit.<br/></li></ul>",
