            "header": "STEP",
            "label": "Modify the condenser seal",
            "body": "<p>on the driver side of the grille for hose clearance:&nbsp;</p><ul><li><strong>Trim 2” from the bottom</strong> for fitting clearance.&nbsp;</li><li>Create a small pass through for the cooler hose: from the <strong>top of the seal</strong>, mark <strong>7” to 9” down</strong>; from the side, mark <strong>1 3/4” to 3” in</strong>. Cut that opening cleanly.<br/><br/><br/></li></ul>",
